200.600x338.jpg?t=1757070086"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/73acb0db2b4a2d141ed8d82a04257bbcdbc5923f/ss_73acb0db2b4a2d141ed8d82a04257bbcdbc5923f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757070086","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/73acb0db2b4a2d141ed8d82a04257bbcdbc5923f/ss_73acb0db2b4a2d141ed8d82a04257bbcdbc5923f.600x338.jpg?t=1757070086"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/11798cb488bee77dc4c760905e4a78fb09c5a5ce/ss_11798cb488bee77dc4c760905e4a78fb09c5a5ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757070086","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/11798cb488bee77dc4c760905e4a78fb09c5a5ce/ss_11798cb488bee77dc4c760905e4a78fb09c5a5ce.600x338.jpg?t=1757070086"}],"short_description":"Pilot your mech through the wasteland. Build a base, plant, hack, dig, trade and forge alliances. Get weapons like lasers, heat-seeking missiles and the devastating 12-inch cannon. Break free from the oppression of a mad general and reunite with your family in this post-apocalyptic adventure.","steam_appid":2482110,"support_info":{"email":"mail@sinkingdutchman.com","url":"http://www.sinkingdutchman.com"},"supported_languages":"English, German, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese","type":"game","website":null}